{
  "id": "HEB.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "HEB",
  "reference": "VaHebheru 2",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bhaibheri Dzvene Rakasununguka MuChiShona Chanhasi™ Kopakodzero © 2005, 2018 ne Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Shona Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 2005, 2018 by Biblica, Inc.",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yambiro pamusoro poKusateerera",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saka tinofanira kuteerera zvikuru, izvo zvatakanzwa, kuitira kuti tirege kutsauka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti kana shoko rakataurwa navatumwa rakanga rakasimba, uye kana kudarika nokusateerera kwose kwakapiwa chirango chakafanira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ko, isu tichapunyuka sei kana tisina hanya noruponeso rwakakura zvakadai? Ruponeso urwu rwakatanga kuziviswa naIshe, rwakasimbiswa kwatiri naavo vakamunzwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwariwo akarupupurira nezviratidzo, zvishamiso, mabasa esimba akasiyana-siyana, uye nezvipo zvoMweya Mutsvene nokuda kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu akaitwa Munhu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapazi pasi pavatumwa pakaiswa nyika inouya, yatiri kutaura nezvayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi mumwe akapupura kwazvo pane imwe nzvimbo achiti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 2:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ko, munhu chii zvamunomufunga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 2:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kana mwanakomana womunhu zvamune hanya naye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makamuita muduku zvishoma kuvatumwa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 2:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "makamushongedza korona yokubwinya nokukudzwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye mukaisa zvinhu zvose pasi petsoka dzake.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "HEB 2:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pakuisa zvinhu zvose pasi pake, Mwari haana kusiya chinhu chimwe chete chisina kuiswa pasi pake. Asi panguva ino hationi zvinhu zvose zvakaiswa pasi pake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi tinoona Jesu, akaitwa muduku zvishoma kuvatumwa, zvino ashongedzwa korona yokubwinya nokukudzwa nokuti akatambudzika murufu, kuitira kuti nenyasha dzaMwari anzwe rufu nokuda kwavose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuuyisa vanakomana vazhinji pakubwinya, zvakanga zvakafanira kuti Mwari iye akaitirwa zvinhu zvose uye akaita kuti zvinhu zvose zvivepo, aite muvambi woruponeso rwazvo rwakakwana nenzira yokutambudzika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vose, iye anoita kuti vanhu vave vatsvene uye avo vanoitwa vatsvene ndevemhuri imwe chete. Saka Jesu haana nyadzi kuti avaidze hama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 2:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ndichaparidza zita renyu kuhama dzangu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 2:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pamberi peungano ndichaimba nziyo dzokukurumbidzai.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyezve anoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 2:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ndichavimba naye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "HEB 2:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uyezve anoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 2:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ndiri pano, navana vandakapiwa naMwari.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sezvo vana vane ropa nenyama, naiyewo akagovana navo pakuva nyama kwavo, kuitira kuti rufu rwake ruparadze iye ane simba rorufu, iye dhiabhori",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye agosunungura vaya vakanga vakasungwa muuranda upenyu hwavo hwose nokutya kwavo rufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti zvirokwazvo havasi vatumwa vaakabatsira, asi zvizvarwa zvaAbhurahama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuda kwemhaka iyi aifanira kuitwa sehama dzake munzira yose, kuitira kuti agova muprista mukuru ane tsitsi uye akatendeka muushumiri kuna Mwari, uye kuti ayananise vanhu nokuda kwezvivi zvavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti iye amene akatambudzika paakaedzwa, anokwanisa kubatsira vanoedzwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
